From: beitlab Robotics MilkV duo OS <image/patches>
Subject: [PATCH 10] buildroot: python3 for the Studio, Studio boot-volume markers

Local change for OS 0.5.0 (PROMPT.md "Studio link and hardware identity").

- python3 with the standard library, compiled .pyc and the ssl module (HTTPS to
  the Studio). No pip and no third-party packages. It runs beitlab-link and
  students' Linux programs; rtos-agent stays a static C program.
- The boot volume gets playground/studio-supported (the PC tools refuse Studio
  settings on older images) and playground/board (duos_standalone or
  robotics_board_rev011), so configure-image.py can check the image variant.
  Both come from the rootfs overlay's /boot/playground, like the other markers.
---
diff --git a/buildroot/configs/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd_defconfig b/buildroot/configs/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd_defconfig
index feb880d..6c4bfee 100644
--- a/buildroot/configs/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd_defconfig
+++ b/buildroot/configs/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd_defconfig
@@ -39,6 +39,9 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_SPI_TOOLS=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_CA_CERTIFICATES=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOPENSSL_BIN=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOPENSSL_ENGINES=y
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3=y
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PY_PYC=y
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SSL=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_C_PERIPHERY=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUSB=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUSB_EXAMPLES=y
diff --git a/device/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd/genimage.cfg b/device/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd/genimage.cfg
index 59b1a8b..077b9ab 100644
--- a/device/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd/genimage.cfg
+++ b/device/milkv-duos-glibc-arm64-sd/genimage.cfg
@@ -14,6 +14,12 @@ image boot.vfat {
 		file playground/user-supported {
 			image = "fs/boot/playground/user-supported"
 		}
+		file playground/studio-supported {
+			image = "fs/boot/playground/studio-supported"
+		}
+		file playground/board {
+			image = "fs/boot/playground/board"
+		}
 	}
 	size = 128M
 }
